@startuml D-ROB-DASH-003 — Diagrama de Robustez: Visualizar Dashboard
title ZARIX — Diagrama de Robustez - Visualizar Dashboard (CU-003)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam handwritten false
' ══ Identidad visual Zarix — paleta esmeralda (DESIGN.md) sobre convención de cátedra ══
skinparam roundCorner 10
skinparam TitleFontColor #065F46
skinparam TitleFontSize 15
skinparam TitleFontStyle bold
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam ArrowFontColor #475569
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.2
skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor #DCFCE7
  BorderColor #16A34A
  FontColor #064E3B
}
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #F0FDF4
  BorderColor #16A34A
  FontColor #052E16
}
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #94A3B8
  FontColor #334155
}
skinparam boundary {
  BackgroundColor #DBEAFE
  BorderColor #2563EB
  FontColor #1E3A8A
}
skinparam control {
  BackgroundColor #FEF9C3
  BorderColor #CA8A04
  FontColor #713F12
}
skinparam entity {
  BackgroundColor #DCFCE7
  BorderColor #16A34A
  FontColor #064E3B
}
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #F0FDF4
  BorderColor #16A34A
  HeaderBackgroundColor #DCFCE7
  FontColor #052E16
  AttributeFontColor #334155
  StereotypeFontColor #16A34A
}
skinparam package {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #16A34A
  FontColor #064E3B
  FontStyle bold
}
skinparam node {
  BackgroundColor #F0FDF4
  BorderColor #16A34A
  FontColor #052E16
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #DCFCE7
  BorderColor #16A34A
  FontColor #064E3B
}
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #F0FDF4
  BorderColor #16A34A
  FontColor #052E16
}
skinparam cloud {
  BackgroundColor #EFF6FF
  BorderColor #3B82F6
  FontColor #1E3A8A
}
skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor #DCFCE7
  BorderColor #16A34A
  FontColor #064E3B
}
skinparam sequence {
  LifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #F0FDF4
  GroupBackgroundColor #DCFCE7
  GroupBorderColor #16A34A
  GroupFontColor #064E3B
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FEFCE8
  BorderColor #EAB308
  FontColor #713F12
}
skinparam legend {
  BackgroundColor #F0FDF4
  BorderColor #16A34A
  FontColor #064E3B
}


left to right direction
actor "Usuario" as U
boundary "Dashboard" as B_Dash
boundary "Patrimonio" as B_Pat
boundary "Flujo / mercado /\npresupuestos" as B_Sec
control "DashboardPage\n(Suspense)" as C_Dash
control "Servicios de cuentas\ne inversiones" as C_Data
control "Servicios de historial\ny resúmenes" as C_Sec
entity "accounts /\ninvestments" as E_Pos
entity "net_worth_snapshots" as E_Hist
entity "transactions /\nbudgets / reglas" as E_Flow

U --> B_Dash : Abre
B_Dash --> C_Dash : Solicita datos
C_Dash --> C_Data : Pide patrimonio
C_Data --> E_Pos : Lee por user_id
C_Data --> B_Pat : Presenta resultado
C_Dash --> C_Sec : Pide secciones
C_Sec --> E_Hist : Lee historial
C_Sec --> E_Flow : Lee por user_id
C_Sec --> B_Sec : Presenta resultados

note bottom of C_Dash
Secciones independientes con Suspense.
Un error se muestra como no disponible.
La visita no escribe snapshots.
end note
note bottom of E_Hist
NetWorthSnapshotJob escribe diariamente
solo con datos financieros completos.
Ver Figura 12 (Template Method).
end note

legend right
Proyecto: ZARIX — TIF UAI 2026
Autor: Jeffrey Dietz | ICONIX — CU-003
Fuente: dashboard/page.tsx y servicios
Auditoría 2026-09-14 — Next.js 15 + Supabase
Boundary: vista | Control: lógica | Entity: tabla
endlegend
@enduml
